{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#card-zh","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的前端界面控件拾取插件。它通过本机 HTTP 桥接服务连接正在开发的网页和 DSH 输入框：在网页中点选控件后，会整理标签、文本、属性、组件名、CSS 选择器、XPath、尺寸和样式，再把描述插入当前会话。支持单个控件即时发送，也支持 Shift 多选后批量发送，并提供悬浮按钮、悬停高亮及连接失败时复制文本的后备方式。适合需要让 DSH 根据页面中的具体控件修改界面的前端开发者。默认使用本机 127.0.0.1:17857 桥接，无需额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:201-237","picker.js:650-690","index.js:101-109","client.js:120-143"]}
{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#card-en","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ui-picker sends page controls to the DSH composer with text, component, CSS selector, XPath, size, and styles. Pick one control or batch several with Shift. Hover highlighting and clipboard fallback are supported. The local bridge defaults to 127.0.0.1:17857; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:201-237","picker.js:650-690","index.js:101-109","client.js:120-143"]}
