{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#feature-element","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 的功能「控件详情采集」：在网页拾取模式中点击一个界面元素，会整理它的标签、文本、属性、CSS 选择器、XPath、组件信息、尺寸和样式，并生成可供 DSH 使用的描述。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:201-237","picker.js:294-321"]}
{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#feature-multi","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 的功能「多控件批选」：按住 Shift 点击可把多个页面控件加入一批，按 Enter 或发送按钮后会将它们编号整理成一条描述并发送；Esc 可取消本次选择。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:650-700","picker.js:324-354"]}
{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#feature-bridge","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 的功能「桥接到会话」：页面端将控件描述 POST 到本机桥接，DSH 网页客户端通过轮询获取新内容，并通过输入框接口插入当前会话；无法发送时页面端会尝试复制文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:356-377","index.js:118-160","client.js:120-143"]}
{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#feature-highlight","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 的功能「悬停定位」：开启拾取后，移动鼠标会在目标控件周围显示定位反馈，点击即可选中；可通过浮动按钮或 Ctrl+Shift+P 开关拾取模式。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:605-613","picker.js:694-700","picker.js:700-720"]}
{"unit_id":"ztlovelsw__dsh-ui-picker#caveat-local-bridge","repo":"ztlovelsw/dsh-ui-picker","commit":"f4e03956ad67e53c8acffbf36a8da0d27ed3aad5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ui-picker 使用本机 127.0.0.1 桥接页面和 DSH：被选控件的描述及页面标题、URL 会发送到该本机服务，再进入 DSH 会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["picker.js:357-377","index.js:101-109","index.js:118-134"]}
